  "description": "Highly efficient, lock-free double buffering library for .NET inspired by the DirectX swap chain. Supports single-writer multiple-reader (SWMR) concurrency with zero allocations, Native AOT, and trimming.",
  "id": "Buffering",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-22T01:34:04.573Z",
